/extras/84eb27c615231e545272398493edfa7b.mp4?t=1775158136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>However, in this game, a cure has been found. All the infected people have been treated and are now normal, functioning, harmless humans again. Except for one thing, the cured people’s skin color is still green. Play as a Green man.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661900/extras/6525efbd8f9bbd2193b75d5add2e9383.poster.avif?t=1775158136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661900/extras/6525efbd8f9bbd2193b75d5add2e9383.webm?t=1775158136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661900/extras/6525efbd8f9bbd2193b75d5add2e9383.mp4?t=1775158136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Human Apocalypse is a game set in a post-POST-apocalyptic world focusing on story, characters, decisions, and exploration. The dark, bizarre world of this game has a deep thought-provoking story, full of interesting characters to meet, a city to freely roam and explore, tough decisions to make, an original soundtrack, beautiful visuals, lots of secrets to uncover.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661900/extras/8fba9dca4609e2bbb91276e5d05d41fc.poster.avif?t=1775158136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661900/extras/8fba9dca4609e2bbb91276e5d05d41fc.webm?t=1775158136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1661900/extras/8fba9dca4609e2bbb91276e5d05d41fc.mp4?t=1775158136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Soundtrack included when buyin